      "text": "Frequency Once per day\n\n---\n\nEffect The dragon permanently befouls 10 cubic feet of liquid within 90 feet. The liquid becomes undrinkable and unable to support water-breathing life.\n\nThis destroys liquid magic or alchemical items if they're of a lower level than the dragon (a creature can attempt a DC 41 Will save save to protect liquids in its possession). This doesn't affect liquids in a creature's body.",
